  "bodyHash": "941ba2522db125f1",
  "content": "\n\n<h2><span style=\"color:#f60;font-size:36px\"><strong>MOA DECOR: 艺术</strong></span></h2>\n<p>ART 是一款旨在为你的建筑增添新艺术主题物品的装饰模组。目前已有许多模组添加了家具，本模组旨在成为其中的又一补充，因为你可以找到数百种不同的物品和元素来装饰你的世界。作为<strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">MOA DECOR</span></strong>系列目录中的又一作品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/624/moa-arte10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"750\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>合成：</strong></h4>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/53/c-arte-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<p>模组中的所有物品均可在生存模式中获得。要开始制作这些物品，你需要在工作台上放置一块<strong>橙色</strong>染料和一个绿宝石，这样你将获得<strong>9个艺术宝石</strong>。利用它们与其他材料合成，即可获取各种装饰物品。<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>共有150种不同的物品！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/55/c-arte-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"358\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<p><strong>示例：</strong>如果你想获得吉他模型，合成时必须使用一个艺术宝石，此外还需要该物品所需的额外材料（在此例中为木板、木棍和线）。还有一些衍生合成配方是由两种模型物品组合而成的。在这些情况下，则不需要艺术宝石，因为它已在之前的合成中被消耗了。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/57/moa-arte1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"354\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/58/moa-arte2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"361\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/59/moa-arte3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"356\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/60/moa-arte4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1473\" height=\"459\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/61/moa-arte5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"376\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/62/moa-arte6.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/516/63/moa-arte7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"339\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/626/moa-arte8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1465\" height=\"846\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/699/625/moa-arte9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1302\" height=\"993\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>注意：</strong></span>为了获得更完整的体验，建议查看<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>MOA DECOR</strong>系列目录</span>中的其他模组，其中包含更多能与此模组互补的类别。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-cookery\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/472/638039093834758638.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 烹饪\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-art\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/441/638039045898196915.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 艺术\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-science\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/488/638039109952819535.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 科学\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-toys\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/636/495/638039124454094910.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 玩具\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-bath\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/808/248/638178193015946116.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 浴室\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-lights\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/853/442/638257035280816288.png\" alt=\"MOA DECOR: 灯光\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></span></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-garden\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/872/565/638291506409003759.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moa-decor-holidays\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/885/795/638321626215674397.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>",
